[[Zaishen Mage]]s are [[Elementalist]] Zaishen Henchmen found in [[PvP]] areas involving the [[Zaishen]]. They can also be found in the [[PvE]] outpost [[Tomb of the Primeval Kings]], since it used to be the lobby for the [[Heroes' Ascent]].

